{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b0cbb017c2de95d2","name":"Instantly Fusing Attachment Disk","source":{"id":"source:reference-b0cbb017c2de95d2","title":"Instantly Fusing Attachment Disk","revision":23105,"timestamp":"2024-09-15T18:21:55Z","sha256":"2a06c4e244c6a5565da7a816ac650062d31f05f02a3c9ca714b0e609e6acaed4","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=23105","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Instantly%20Fusing%20Attachment%20Disk&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b0cbb017c2de95d2","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 15\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Attaching a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restraining Bolt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restraining_Bolt","referenceId":"reference:f385e818f02da932"}," quickly and at range is challenging. Using Instantly Fusing Attachment Disks is a must. Heroes can find these unusual devices in civilized centers and from outlaw tech dealers at triple the cost of regular ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restraining Bolts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restraining_Bolts"},". A Jedi can use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Light Object"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Light_Object"}," to slap a bolt on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},". Others can use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," to get close enough to attach the disk. Some agents modify the disk to instantly activate when attached (",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," DC 15), paralyzing the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},". In some ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," models, the bolts must be attached in specific locations to be effective.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
